  "title": "CORPORATE SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY",
  "summary": "CSR refers to the responsibility of enterprises for their impacts on society, makingcompanies socially accountable to themselves, stakeholders, and the public. It involves practices and policies intended tohave a positive influence beyond legal obligations and profit maximization. The European Commission defines CSR as enterprises taking responsibility for their societal impacts, emphasizing that businesses must comply with laws, act ethically, and contribute to communities.",
